            714
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "读到一本好书和同学妈妈买回新鲜的草莓分享游戏新玩法和家人爸爸给我买了生日蛋糕分享",
          "block_bbox": [
            238,
            781,
            953,
            1161
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "二、我会选一选",
          "block_bbox": [
            182,
            1259,
            535,
            1307
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "①想办法②美味③快乐",
          "block_bbox": [
            319,
            1364,
            897,
            1407
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "1.我把妈妈做的饼干带给同学们吃，他们觉得饼干很(）。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            263,
            1465,
            976,
            1608
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "image",
          "block_content": "练一练综合技能",
          "block_bbox": [
            1226,
            450,
            1595,
            525
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": null
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "2.我把自己的困难讲给老师听，他会帮我( )。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            1073,
            634,
            1808,
            776
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "3.我给小伙伴们唱了一首好听的歌，他们会感到很(）。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            1074,
            834,
            1809,
            978
          ],
          "block_id": 10,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "三、我会写一写",
